    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "go bahlanka ba kgoši",
      "rationale": "kgoši e bolela ka go lebana le bahlanka ba yona bošego — polelo ya go lebana le batho ba itseng"
    },
    {
      "kind": "elision",
      "subject": "העיר ya pele (כי יצאו מן העיר)",
      "rationale": "mokgwa wa Sepedi o ngwala toropo ga tee — go bolela gabedi 'toropong toropong' go ka se fele setšhaba; e ngwadile gabedi ga šomišwa go šireletša palo ya mantšu fela, e le gantši ga e tlhokege"
    },
    {
      "kind": "mystery",
      "subject": "maikemišetšo a Arame",
      "rationale": "kgoši e hlahloba melaetša ye e sa tsebjwego ya mokgwaro o se nago batho — teko ya go hlalosa seo ga go motho a ka se hlalosago"
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme kgoši e tloga bošego, ya re go bahlanka ba yona: A ke le tsebiše ⟨את⟩ se Arame a se dirilego go rena. Ba tseba gore re lapile; ke ka baka leo ba tswilego go mokgwaro go ithetla nageng, ba re: Ge ba tšwa toropong, re ba tšware ba phela, gomme re tsene toropong.",
